- Bullish news sentiment (+0.36) suggests positive catalysts ahead of earnings
- High liquidity ($2.5M open interest, $800K daily volume) ensures easy entry/exit
- Spiking volume indicates increased market interest and potential momentum

**RISK_FACTORS:**
- Strong bearish momentum (-0.080) and negative rate of change (-8%) suggest recent selling pressure
- Earnings are inherently volatile events with binary outcomes
- Technical indicators showing bearish MA signal could indicate continued weakness
- Market may have information not reflected in historical beat rates

