Given that we're approaching a Fed decision, this market requires high conviction based on fundamental Fed analysis rather than technical trading signals. Without clear insight into Fed communications, economic data, or market expectations beyond the futures pricing, the conflicting signals don't provide sufficient edge to justify a position.

