- Massive 27-point gap between market price (38%) and Vegas odds (65%)
- Severely oversold RSI at 25 suggests technical overcorrection
- High liquidity with $1.2M daily volume enables good execution
- Binary playoff outcome with clear, near-term resolution
- Neutral sentiment suggests no fundamental negative catalysts

**RISK_FACTORS:**
- Strong bearish momentum (-15% rate of change) could continue
- Wide spread (5.26%) increases transaction costs
- High volatility regime suggests unpredictable price swings
- Vegas odds could be stale or inaccurate for this specific matchup
- Playoff games can be unpredictable regardless of regular season performance

