- Strong bearish technical momentum (-0.100) conflicts with oversold RSI (28) suggesting potential reversal
- Low social engagement and mixed sentiment provide insufficient conviction signals

**RISK_FACTORS:**
- Unclear which pricing mechanism (futures vs prediction market) is more accurate
- Fed policy decisions can be highly unpredictable and driven by last-minute data
- Low conviction setup could lead to whipsaw price action in either direction

**MARKET_EDGE:**
