- Strong bearish technical momentum with oversold RSI conditions
- Neutral sentiment across all sources provides no directional catalyst
- High liquidity market with $600K daily volume suggests efficient pricing

**RISK_FACTORS:**
- Fed policy decisions can be highly unpredictable and data-dependent
- Recent bearish momentum may indicate informed selling pressure
- Generic news coverage provides no insight into actual Fed policy drivers
