- Large discrepancy between futures pricing (75%) and Kalshi implied probability (42%)
- Conflicting technical signals (oversold RSI vs bearish momentum)
- Bullish sentiment contradicting bearish technical momentum
- Insufficient specific Fed policy information in news analysis

**RISK_FACTORS:**
- High volatility around Fed announcements can cause rapid price swings
- Information asymmetry between institutional futures markets and prediction markets
