The technical indicators show oversold conditions (RSI at 25) and strong bearish momentum, suggesting the market may have overcorrected to the downside. The high volume spike indicates increased interest, and with excellent liquidity ($3M open interest, $1.2M daily volume), execution risk is minimal. While sentiment is neutral across news and social media, this actually supports the thesis that the market may be underreacting to the fundamental probability assessment reflected in Vegas odds.

