- Lack of Fed-specific news or economic data to validate either pricing

**RISK_FACTORS:**
- Uncertainty about which market (futures vs. Kalshi) is correctly priced
- Missing crucial Fed communications or recent economic data
- Technical bearish momentum could continue despite oversold conditions
